Package: lindalf
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libasound2
Description: Terminal ASCII animation of a wizard smoking a pipe
 lindalf renders a colourful ANSI-art wizard relaxing with a pipe
 in your terminal at 24 FPS.  A smoke particle system rises from the
 pipe, colours shift between animation frames, and a soft fade-in
 curtain opens the scene.
 .
 Optionally plays a WAV music file through ALSA with real-time DSP:
 volume control, LFO tremolo modulation, and feedback-delay reverb —
 all adjustable live from the keyboard.
 .
 No copyrighted audio is included; supply your own with --music.
